It turns on, per boot and per machine, two programs by others: dmemcg-booster
by Natalie Vock (Valve Corporation, MIT) and the KDE Foreground Booster by
Henri Chain and David Redondo with Natalie Vock's dmem changes (LGPL-2.1+),
for the dmem cgroup controller by Maarten Lankhorst, Maxime Ripard and
Natalie Vock and the TTM eviction protection Natalie Vock wrote for Linux 7.3.
It contains none of their code.

